{"ref":"BDB, שְׁחִין²","hw":"שְׁחִין²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁחִין</span></big>  <strong>n.m. boil</strong>, coll. <strong>eruption</strong>;—on man <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.7\">2 K 20:7</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.21\">Is 38:21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ רָ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:35\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.35\">Dt 28:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 2:7\" href=\"/Job.2.7\">Jb 2:7</a>; possibly leprous <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.18\">Lv 13:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.20\">20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צָרֶ֫בֶת הַשּׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.23\">13:23</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, צ\" href=\"/BDB,_צ\", dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</a>; all P), in Egypt, on man and beast <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:9\" href=\"/Exodus.9.9\">Ex 9:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:10\" href=\"/Exodus.9.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:11\" href=\"/Exodus.9.11\">11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (all P), cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁחִין מִצְרַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.27\">Dt 28:27</a>.","next":"BDB, שׁחף","prev":"BDB, שׁחן"}